<rml>
<head>
  <title>Fotbiler Youth Academy</title>
  <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss" />
  <link type="text/rcss" href="career_shell.rcss" />
  <link type="text/rcss" href="career_detail.rcss" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="career-screen">
    <div class="career-bg-deep"></div><div class="career-bg-blue"></div><div class="career-bg-accent"></div>
    <div class="career-shell">
      <div class="career-topbar">
        <div class="club-identity"><div class="club-crest">F</div><div class="club-copy"><div id="career-club-name" class="club-name">FOTBILER FC</div><div id="career-club-meta" class="club-meta">MANAGER CAREER · SEASON 2026/27</div></div></div>
        <div class="career-status"><div class="status-block"><div class="status-label">ACADEMY</div><div id="youth-count" class="status-value">5</div></div><div class="status-block date-block"><div class="status-label">REGION</div><div id="youth-region" class="status-value">TURKEY</div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="career-tabs"><div class="career-tab" tabindex="0" data-route="career-central">CENTRAL</div><div class="career-tab active" tabindex="0" data-route="squad">SQUAD</div><div class="career-tab" tabindex="0" data-route="transfers">TRANSFERS</div><div class="career-tab" tabindex="0" data-route="office">OFFICE</div><div class="career-tab" tabindex="0" data-route="season">SEASON</div></div>

      <div class="career-detail-content">
        <div class="career-detail-main">
          <div class="ui-card career-detail-card full" tabindex="0">
            <div class="card-kicker">DEVELOPMENT PIPELINE</div><div class="career-detail-title">YOUTH ACADEMY</div><div class="career-detail-subtitle">Academy prospects are sourced directly from CareerSave youth state.</div>
            <div class="detail-list-head"><span style="width:38%">PLAYER</span><span style="width:12%">POS</span><span style="width:12%">AGE</span><span style="width:18%">OVR</span><span class="right" style="width:20%">POT</span></div>
            <div class="detail-list-row active"><strong id="youth-name-0" style="width:38%">EMIR KAYA</strong><span id="youth-pos-0" style="width:12%">CM</span><span id="youth-age-0" style="width:12%">17</span><span id="youth-ovr-0" style="width:18%">62</span><span id="youth-pot-0" class="right" style="width:20%">84</span></div>
            <div class="detail-list-row"><strong id="youth-name-1" style="width:38%">CAN OZDEMIR</strong><span id="youth-pos-1" style="width:12%">ST</span><span id="youth-age-1" style="width:12%">16</span><span id="youth-ovr-1" style="width:18%">60</span><span id="youth-pot-1" class="right" style="width:20%">86</span></div>
            <div class="detail-list-row"><strong id="youth-name-2" style="width:38%">BERK ASLAN</strong><span id="youth-pos-2" style="width:12%">CB</span><span id="youth-age-2" style="width:12%">17</span><span id="youth-ovr-2" style="width:18%">61</span><span id="youth-pot-2" class="right" style="width:20%">82</span></div>
            <div class="detail-list-row"><strong id="youth-name-3" style="width:38%">ALI DEMIR</strong><span id="youth-pos-3" style="width:12%">RW</span><span id="youth-age-3" style="width:12%">16</span><span id="youth-ovr-3" style="width:18%">59</span><span id="youth-pot-3" class="right" style="width:20%">83</span></div>
            <div class="detail-list-row"><strong id="youth-name-4" style="width:38%">MERT AKIN</strong><span id="youth-pos-4" style="width:12%">GK</span><span id="youth-age-4" style="width:12%">17</span><span id="youth-ovr-4" style="width:18%">58</span><span id="youth-pot-4" class="right" style="width:20%">80</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="career-detail-side">
          <div class="ui-card career-detail-card top dark" tabindex="0"><div class="card-kicker">ACADEMY FOCUS</div><div class="career-detail-title light">PLAYER DEVELOPMENT</div><div class="detail-stat-grid"><div class="detail-stat accent"><span>REGION</span><strong id="youth-region-copy">TURKEY</strong></div><div class="detail-stat"><span>MONTHLY INTAKE</span><strong id="youth-intake">2</strong></div><div class="detail-stat"><span>PROMOTED</span><strong id="youth-promoted">0</strong></div></div><span class="detail-action primary">PROMOTE PLAYER</span><span class="detail-action">RELEASE</span></div>
          <div class="ui-card career-detail-card bottom muted" tabindex="0"><div class="card-kicker">ACADEMY STRATEGY</div><div class="career-detail-title">LONG-TERM PIPELINE</div><div class="detail-note">Youth prospects retain CareerSave player IDs and can move into the senior squad without creating a parallel UI-only player model.</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="career-control-strip"><div class="control-left"><span class="hint"><span class="hint-key">ENTER</span>Select</span><span class="hint"><span class="hint-key">ARROWS</span>Navigate</span><span class="hint"><span class="hint-key">ESC</span>Back</span></div><div class="control-right">SQUAD · YOUTH ACADEMY</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</rml>
